<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - Dutch company results March 17-21.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Dutch company results March 17-21.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch company results for the week of March 17-21:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-----PERIOD--PROFIT------CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS</p>
<p>21/3  Aegon	 Q4 96   net ord ops    451     435/467    380</p>
<p>21/3  Aegon	 YR 96   net ord ops   1550    1535/1567  1323</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They also exclude dividends on preference shares where applicable.</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: Amstgeld, Bangert Pontier, Delta Lloyd Bank, Generale Bank, ING, Kempen &amp; Co, Van Lanschot, NIB Securities, Rabo Securities, Suez Nederland, Wesselius, Wijs &amp; Van Oostveen.</p>
